\" /><br /> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"21\" SemiHidden=\"false\"<br /> UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"Intense Emphasis\" /><br /> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"31\" SemiHidden=\"false\"<br /> UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"Subtle Reference\" /><br /> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"32\" SemiHidden=\"false\"<br /> UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"Intense Reference\" /><br /> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"33\" SemiHidden=\"false\"<br /> UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"Book Title\" /><br /> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"37\" Name=\"Bibliography\" /><br /> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"39\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"TOC Heading\" /><br /> </w:LatentStyles><br /> </xml><![endif]--> <!--[if gte mso 10]><mce:style><!   /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable \t{mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; \tmso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; \tmso-tstyle-colband-size:0; \tmso-style-noshow:yes; \tmso-style-priority:99; \tmso-style-parent:\"\"; \tmso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; \tmso-para-margin:0in; \tmso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; \tmso-pagination:widow-orphan; \tfont-size:10.0pt; \tfont-family:\"Times New Roman\";} -->\r\n<p><!--[endif] --> <!--StartFragment--></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">There are really many online shipping companies in Georgia and appearance of one more does not surprise anyone unless this one will offer something different. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">Gzavnili  LLC is not a new in this market. We were established in January 2009 and since then we ship regularly, twice a week to Georgia and commercial shipments to more then 200 destinations worldwide. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">Gzavnili LLC chooses a different strategy for development. We set a priority; every service, which we will offer to our users, has to be best quality and most affordable. This is why in just few years we become largest shippers of personal items to Georgia. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">Today Gzavnili LLC is ready to offer Georgian market the most advanced online shipping experience. We not going to talk about terms which everyone have; we want to introduce characteristics of our service, which is prevailing over the others.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\"><strong>Advantage # 1:</strong> We deliver cargo to Georgia twice a week. Many companies claim that they do ship every day but it does not mean that they deliver cargo to Georgia is same terms. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\"><strong>Advantage # 2:</strong> Transportation terms with us are 3-4 days from shipping. We ship every Tuesdays and Fridays. Accordingly shipments arrives to Georgia every Monday and Thursdays and available for pick up next day. In these terms we do not consider busy holiday times and any force </span><span style=\"font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #1d1d1d; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">majeure situations</span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">Advantage # 3:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\"> Our offices are working 7 days a week. Exceptions are Christmas, New Year , Easter . </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">Advantage # 4</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Times; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">: Best Customer Service &ndash; Live chat, Email and Phone supports, </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Menlo Regular'; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">Advantage #5: T</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Menlo Regular'; color: #262626; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">he best and most advanced payment system-Amazon Pay. This payment method will help you, without going out to pay your shipping fee just in seconds, which is really convenience service for the users of our service. </span></p>\r\n<p><!--EndFragment--></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- /.node --></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>","header":"Why Us","id":14,"groups":[],"url":"/why-us.html","metaKeywords":"","type":1}